OL,3,GNEWSARoads close as rally returns over
OL,4,Atwo days
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads in the south of the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fare set to close later as the annual
OL,8,FChris Kelly Rally gets underway.
OL,10,FThe event, which is one of two rallies
OL,11,Fheld on closed public roads each year,
OL,12,Fruns through Friday evening from 17:30
OL,13,FBST and most of the following day. The
OL,14,Frally covers 93 miles (150km) over 12
OL,15,Fstage routes, with competitors setting
OL,16,Fon at 30 second intervals.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
